title: Authorizations › New case › Intake › Modification / extension
route: /authorizations/new/:draftId?type=modify (Intake)
intro: A modification asks the payer to change an authorization that is already approved: more days or units, other dates, a different service, or a correction. It is a request, never an approval, and says so. Intake finds the patient and the authorization, then asks what should change and why.
dir: TD
---
start s1 "Pick 'Modification / extension' in 'Authorization type'\nOr open ?type=modify"
screen sc "Intake · Modification / extension\n'Find the patient, then the authorization to change, and say what should change.'"
goto gFind "Continues in: Authorizations › New case › Intake › Find a patient and the authorization"
screen sAuth "Authorization card\nStatus, approved dates, authorized, left, expires on, 'History'"

group gChange "Card 'Proposed change'"
  screen sChg "'Say what should change and why. The payer decides.'\nPill 'Payer approval: not yet. This is a request, not an approval.'"
  input iKind "Pick 'What should change'\nMore units, More days, Revised dates, Different service or level of care, A correction"
  decision dMore "More units or More days?"
  input iAmt "'How many more units' or 'How many more days'\n1 to 90"
  input iWhy "'Why the change is needed'\n'One or two sentences. Scribe uses it in the justification, and only what the chart supports goes in.'"
endgroup

screen sDates "Card 'Dates the change covers'\n'From today, unless the change revises the dates.'"
input iFrom "'Change starts'\nToday"
input iTo "'Change ends' (optional)"
store st "The request is recorded as 'Modification'\nThe change is kept on the case with the authorization's ids\nThe authorization itself is not touched"
decision dEmpty "Is the reason for the change empty?"
toast tEmpty "Review & submit lists 'Proposed change' to acknowledge\n'Say what should change and why. A modification is a request, not an approval.'"
process pDup "A modification is never a duplicate of the authorization it changes\nAnother open request or active authorization for the same dates still is"
goto gDup "Continues in: Authorizations › New case › Intake › Possible duplicate"
process pHist "After sending, the request's History says\n'You asked for a change to the authorization'\n'This is a request, not an approval. Nothing changes until the payer approves it.'"
process pDoc "Typical documents: clinical note that supports the change, updated treatment plan, the current authorization letter"
goto gElig "Continues in: Authorizations › New case › Eligibility & Benefits › Modification / extension"
goto gDocs "Continues in: Authorizations › New case › Clinical documentation › Required and typical documents by type"
goto gJust "Continues in: Authorizations › New case › Authorization preparation › Justification by type"
click cSave "Click 'Save as draft'"
click cCont "Click 'Continue to Eligibility & Benefits'"
goto gSave "Continues in: Authorizations › New case › Save as draft and leave"

s1 --> sc --> gFind
sc --> sAuth --> sChg
sChg --> iKind --> dMore
dMore -->|Yes| iAmt --> iWhy
dMore -->|No| iWhy
iWhy --> dEmpty
dEmpty -->|Yes| tEmpty
dEmpty -->|No| sDates
tEmpty --> sDates
sDates --> iFrom --> iTo --> st
st --> pHist
st --> pDup -.-> gDup
st --> pDoc --> gDocs
st --> gJust
st --> cSave --> gSave
st --> cCont --> gElig
